{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43633","headline":"与潘述集汤衡宅怀李司直纵联句 · 清昼","name":"与潘述集汤衡宅怀李司直纵联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽独何以慰，友人顾茅茨。\n已忘岁月念，载说清闲时。\n旭日舒朱槿，柔风引绿葹。\n迢迢青溪路，耿耿芳树枝。\n执袵空踯躅，来城自逶迤。\n相思寄采掇，景晏独驱驰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}